      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that this is only called if `INIT_classic_discovery_only` is set. We need the `BTM_BLE_INQUIRY_MASK` flag to be set in order to process BLE results. Since we don\u0027t call `btm_ble_start_scan` or `btm_ble_stop_scan`, we need to complete the BLE inquiry mask somehow and this timer will do it.",
